{
    "_description": "CAN retransmission IN — listens to the three frames published by /gauge.s-retransmission-out.json (0x400-0x402, 500 kbps, little-endian) and decodes them back into the MS41 E36 K-line parameters (plus Oil Temp for the E36 M3) under their exact canonical header names. Load on a device whose car has no K-line (or where K-line data should be relayed over CAN): any gauge design or data logger built for the MS/M3EVO files works unchanged on the CAN bus. Fields the transmitting car does not fill stay 0xAA and decode to 170 on 1-byte fields, 43690 (0xAAAA) on 2-byte x1 fields, 122 degC on the +48 temps - mask with min/max or an expr if needed. Frame layout — 0x400: [0-1] Engine Speed u16 x1, [2-3] Engine Load u16 x1, [4] Throttle Position u8, [5] IACV u8, [6-7] Mass Airflow u16 x1; 0x401: [0-1] Ignition Angle i16 x10, [2-3] Fuel Inj u16 x100, [4-5] Lambda Int 1 i16 x10, [6-7] Lambda Int 2 i16 x10; 0x402: [0] Coolant Temp u8 +48, [1] Intake Air Temp u8 +48, [2] Vehicle Speed u8, [3] Battery Voltage u8 x10, [4] Oil Temp u8 +48, [5-7] filler.",
    "canSpeed": 500,
    "ecuparam": [
        {
            "header": "Engine Speed",
            "unit": "RPM",
            "canId": "0x400",
            "offset": 0,
            "length": 2,
            "dec": 0
        },
        {
            "header": "Engine Load",
            "unit": "mg/str",
            "canId": "0x400",
            "offset": 2,
            "length": 2,
            "dec": 1
        },
        {
            "header": "Throttle Position",
            "unit": "%",
            "canId": "0x400",
            "offset": 4,
            "length": 1,
            "dec": 0
        },
        {
            "header": "IACV",
            "unit": "%",
            "canId": "0x400",
            "offset": 5,
            "length": 1,
            "dec": 0
        },
        {
            "header": "Mass Airflow",
            "unit": "kg/h",
            "canId": "0x400",
            "offset": 6,
            "length": 2,
            "dec": 1
        },
        {
            "header": "Ignition Angle",
            "unit": "°CRK",
            "canId": "0x401",
            "offset": 0,
            "length": 2,
            "signed": true,
            "mul": 0.1,
            "dec": 1
        },
        {
            "header": "Fuel Inj",
            "unit": "ms",
            "canId": "0x401",
            "offset": 2,
            "length": 2,
            "mul": 0.01,
            "dec": 2
